WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
You really don’t want to stay in the capital, General

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,560
What the general wants

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,840
Beijing can’t give it

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:12,100
What do you want, general? Let's go home. Let's go home.

5
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,590
I have no children in my life

6
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:19,390
I keep this money for you to take.

7
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:27,650
Train your troops well and break your fortune

8
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,010
You are over thirty

9
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,450
Why don't you get a wife yet?

10
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,370
Mom has chosen several girls for you.

11
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,890
They are all good people, why don't you meet Po Lu?

12
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,450
It’s time for you to start a family

13
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:38,330
I have more important things

14
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,050
Cultivation is more important

15
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,570
Autonomy in this life is not bad

16
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,530
but unfortunately no matter what try

17
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,650
I still can't fuse those two energies.

18
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,090
If you can't find the method to cultivate immortality

19
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:49,050
I may never be able to sell that step in my life.

20
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,650
Chen Huai said that he could now be alone

21
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:53,810
It's time to leave. Think about it and go.

22
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:56,610
I have seen many young people in my life

23
00:00:56,730 --> 00:00:59,890
But a first like you doesn't care where you go

24
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:01,130
This will always be your home

25
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:03,970
Come back anytime you want, General. Take care.

26
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:20,910
Everyone is a cultivator of immortality

27
00:01:20,910 --> 00:01:22,590
I'm just good at it myself
